        "created_at": "2023-10-14T16:31:42.013Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yay! Plague Rat! I’ve always hoped for him to have a redemption. : D</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"FrivYeti\" data-post=\"18\" data-topic=\"30277\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/48/1919_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> FrivYeti:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>traditionally, “Toxic” is a Materials power rather than an elemental one</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yeah, it’s kind of an outlier with the Materials, as it seems pretty energetic to me. Plus it’s the only Material that was a damage type in <em>SotM</em>.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"FrivYeti\" data-post=\"20\" data-topic=\"30277\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/48/1919_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> FrivYeti:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I actually hope, although this is a bit of a long shot, that Dark Watch and similar books, in addition to including different creation options, include adjusted Guided Methods for their genres.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That would definitively be intriguing!</p>",
